<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body class="bg-paper text-ink font-body">
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

  <main id="main-content" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <section class="pt-10 pb-6">
      <span class="inline-block bg-tag text-ink text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-3 -rotate-1 border-2 border-ink">Chat Bantuan</span>
      <h1 class="font-display font-black text-3xl sm:text-4xl mb-1">Tanya AI</h1>
      <p class="text-ink/70">Punya pertanyaan seputar stok, harga, atau jam operasional? Tanyakan di sini.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="chat-title" class="py-4 pb-16 flex flex-col gap-5 max-w-2xl">
      <h2 id="chat-title" class="sr-only">Ruang Percakapan</h2>

      <div id="chatWindow" aria-live="polite" class="bg-white border-2 border-ink rounded-2xl p-5 min-h-[280px] max-h-[420px] overflow-y-auto flex flex-col gap-3" style="box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 0 #1c2b22;">
        <div class="max-w-[85%] bg-market-light border-2 border-market rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm px-4 py-3 text-sm self-start">
          <p>Halo! Aku asisten toko (balasan otomatis dari server, bukan AI eksternal). Coba tanya soal jam buka, ongkir, cara bayar, atau stok produk ya 🙂</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <form id="chatForm" novalidate class="flex flex-wrap items-end gap-3">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 flex-1 min-w-[220px]">
          <label for="chatInput" class="text-sm font-bold">Tulis pertanyaanmu</label>
          <input
            type="text"
            id="chatInput"
            name="pertanyaan"
            placeholder="Contoh: Gula sekilo berapa?"
            autocomplete="off"
            class="border-2 border-ink/30 rounded-xl px-3 py-2.5 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-market"
          />
          <p class="field-error hidden text-xs text-spice font-semibold" data-for="chatInput">Pertanyaan tidak boleh kosong.</p>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" id="chatSubmitBtn" class="px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full font-bold bg-spice text-paper border-2 border-ink hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform">Kirim</button>
      </form>

      <aside aria-label="Contoh pertanyaan" class="bg-white border-2 border-dashed border-ink/30 rounded-2xl px-5 py-4">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-ink/60 mb-2">Contoh pertanyaan yang bisa kamu coba:</h3>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-1 text-sm">
          <li><button type="button" class="chat-suggestion text-spice hover:underline">"Jam buka toko kapan?"</button></li>
          <li><button type="button" class="chat-suggestion text-spice hover:underline">"Bisa antar ga?"</button></li>
          <li><button type="button" class="chat-suggestion text-spice hover:underline">"Bayar pakai apa aja?"</button></li>
          <li><button type="button" class="chat-suggestion text-spice hover:underline">"Beras masih ada stok?"</button></li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>

  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/chat.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
